READING: 'linear-zone' = exact slope*w sums (would vanish under slope balance +
psi symmetry); 'kink-zone' = pairs whose wobble crosses a breakpoint -- its
|mass| vs signed total gives the cancellation ratio AT the kink layer. If the
kink |mass| >> few units with cancel << 1: the wobble bound is signed inside
the kinks (9th confirmation); if kink |mass| itself is few units: provable.
